      "name": "@fuxi-ailabs/crowdmemory-dsh-adapter",
      "title": {
        "en": "Crowd Memory",
        "zh": "Crowd Memory · 群体记忆"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Memory plugin for DSH. When a tool fails, a session starts or a workflow phase begins, it shows the agent records of how the same problem was solved before, with their source and why they matched. Requires the local memory service @fuxi-ailabs/crowdmemory-runtime.",
        "zh": "DSH 记忆插件。工具失败、会话开始或进入工作流阶段时，把以前同类问题的解决记录推送给 Agent，附出处和命中理由。需要先安装本机记忆服务 @fuxi-ailabs/crowdmemory-runtime。"
      },
      "icon": "icons/crowdmemory.svg",
      "author": "cacheline",
      "homepage": "https://fuxi-ailabs.github.io/dsh-plugin-market/plugins/crowdmemory/",
