    {
      "name": "@fuxi-ailabs/workflow-rsi-dsh-console",
      "title": {
        "en": "workflow-rsi Console",
        "zh": "workflow-rsi 操作台"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "workflow-rsi improves a Workflow from its own runs. When a Run stops, it locates the cause from the stop evidence, verifies a fix and opens it as a PR to the Workflow repo, then reruns the same input after merge; people review PRs and decide stops that need them. On a HarmonyOS PC device, its merged fix let the rerun of memray 1.20.0 pass the original stop. This DSH console requires wrsi-server from @fuxi-ailabs/workflow-rsi.",
        "zh": "workflow-rsi 让 Workflow 根据自己的运行结果持续改进：Run 停下后，按停止证据定位原因，验证改动后以 PR 提交到 Workflow 所在的仓，合入后用同一份输入重跑；人负责审 PR 和处理需要人决定的停止。鸿蒙 PC 真机上 memray 1.20.0 的闭环中，它的修复合入后重跑越过了原停止点。需要 @fuxi-ailabs/workflow-rsi 提供的 wrsi-server。"
      },
      "icon": "icons/workflow-rsi.svg",
      "author": "cacheline",
      "homepage": "https://fuxi-ailabs.github.io/dsh-plugin-market/plugins/workflow-rsi/",
